# These directories are the whole point of the fixture repositories below:
# the discovery walk in backend/presets/017-portfolio-review.yaml must
# refuse to descend into them, and a test can only assert that if they are
# in the checkout. The repository root .gitignore excludes them because a
# real .venv, node_modules or build directory is a local artifact; these
# are synthetic traps holding one manifest each, so re-include them.
!.venv/
!node_modules/
!build/
